rota lap 4645, row 0 -- Aether, the row that hears. Read the threshold page, then Follow Our Compass (cardinal), the Lindy effect (fixed), and the Grain and the Crossing (dual). The row's own instruction is to listen for the page nobody answered, and a door naming no room is exactly that page -- so the rota and my open door named one lap. Lindy sharpened the choice of which 39: a design capture and a silo are read years after the code they describe, so the register they are read in is worth a line each.
