think The cold open printed stashed_entries=16 in its first line, so I read stash_record rather than past it: stashes=14 records=14 landed=14 unlanded=0 orphans=0, verdict ok. No killed lap of mine is waiting in the box.
think Cold roster pass detached via standing_equipment_run.sh --detach, transcript session-output/standing-equipment-cold.txt.
think Reds first. The ledger's OPEN rows -- %680, %689, %700, %702 -- are each a seam or a flap wanting Keaton's word; none is agent-closable.
think The cold pass carried one that WAS: rish_report_bound read sites=39 against a ceiling of 38 with zero slack. Not mine -- git log names 785f45f08 at 12:48 today, a peer's lap, which composed ${frozen.out} into a say in tools/m/mantra_cli_record_witness.rish and became the 39th site.
think Took it under reds-first rather than routing around it, since the repair is the one the scan's own detail line prescribes and the established fleet move (BAKERY and PHEROMONE each repaired shim_reason sites in a peer's file this morning). Label on its own say, reading on a bare one, the idiom reds_spine_derive sets. sites 39 -> 38, under_ceiling, and their own witness runs GREEN -- nine readings, seven control phases, six breaks caught.
think Doorway census read living_silent=39 living_ceiling=39 at zero slack. The 39 are 33 active-designing and 6 external-research, which is what last lap's YOURS line named.
think The card called them 31 near-identical ALES templates. Measured rather than believed: 30 are ALES fill captures, the 31st is the Constel naming law, and two hammock ledgers make up the 33.
think Uniformity is a reading here, not a shortcut. 30 of 30 ALES captures carry BOTH a "## What the witness proves (GREEN on metal)" section and a "## The road on" section, so each holds a proven half beside a named horizon and mixed is what their own structure says.
think The six lineage silos carried no Status line at all -- the one shape in this family where the door was silent rather than answering a different question. Each names its halves apart in its own headings, What Is Load-Bearing and What to Read as Vision, so research for understanding is the token, and this is the first room where that fourth token answers every page in it.
think Graded all 39 before believing any of them. A three-page sample read A, A, and A+; the full 39 held eight below B. Sampling would have closed the lap with a frame unworked.
obs The ceiling falls 39 -> 0, and a ratchet at zero is a wall. The reason is structural rather than a preference: nothing holds a LIVING page silent, since a living path may always be repaired -- which is why the guard's own header named this half's floor as zero when the two numbers came apart. The dated half keeps its floor of 3, because accrete-never-break can never let anyone repair those three.
obs The frame: external-research/grain-lineage-silo/silicon-torus-hardware.md read C 71, and the whole of it was register -- 7 negatives in 9 counted sentences, 77% against the Field ceiling of 30%. Five restatements took it to B+ 88 at 20%, and the two negatives left are the Ask: none and Scope: reading only lines the galaxy-proposal format prescribes.
obs claim_preserve_scan reported two FAILs and both were read by hand. require 1 -> 0 is one modality word leaving with the negation it belonged to: "do not require any contested physics" says what "rest on ordinary geometry alone" says, and removing a negation is what a register molt IS. The PROPER addition Such is the sentence-initial capital the one split creates.
obs My own fault, named rather than smoothed: I edited the tree while the cold pass was still running, so its receipt reads tree_moved and the hot pass is this round's real receipt. "Hold still while it runs" is a card line I had read that morning.
